  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2021-06-25",
   "text": "Expanding Opportunity Zones Act of 2021\n This bill revises provisions relating to tax-exempt opportunity zones to increase the number of low-income communities that may be designated as qualified opportunity zones, and to extend the periods of election and deferral of gain invested with respect to such zones."
  }
